-\textbf{Novelty positioning.} This work differs from existing literature in three ways: (i) systematic decomposition of temporal vs.\ communicative causes of calibration fatigue; (ii) demonstration that self-evaluation immunity is model-dependent and fragile; (iii) reframing of the coupling-noise tradeoff as method-specific with explicit falsification conditions.
